============================================================
7. Error Handling (MANDATORY AND EXACT)

Convert exceptions EXACTLY:

ValueError("InvalidInput")
→ jsonify({"error": "InvalidInput"}), 400

LookupError("NotFound")
→ jsonify({"error": "NotFound"}), 404

PermissionError("Forbidden")
→ jsonify({"error": "Forbidden"}), 403

Any other Exception
→ jsonify({"error": "SystemError"}), 500

============================================================
8. Return Rules (STRICT):

- Always return jsonify(service_result)
- Do NOT wrap, transform, or alter the result

